%N A192493 Numerators of squared radii of circumcircles of non-degenerate triangles with integer vertex coordinates.
%H A192493 Hugo Pfoertner, <a href="/A192493/b192493.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..9089</a>, covering range R^2 <= 100.
